---
title: Future - agent-initiated payment with mandate and human confirmation
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant PA as PaymentsAgent
    participant RA as RiskAgent
    participant M as MCP gateway
    participant R as Capability registry
    participant B as Command bus
    participant P as Policy engine + mandates
    participant L as Ledger
    participant T as Trace + audit

    U->>O: "send 200 lei to Ana for rent"
    O->>T: open agent_run, correlation_id
    O->>O: classify intent, plan

    par read-only workers in parallel
        O->>M: accounts.get_balance
        and
        O->>M: payments.list_beneficiaries
    end
    M->>R: resolve registered capabilities only
    R-->>M: read results
    M-->>O: balance, beneficiary candidates

    Note over O,PA: money movement is sequential,<br/>single writer, never parallel

    O->>PA: build proposal, objective + boundaries + output format
    PA->>M: payments.propose_internal_transfer
    M->>R: effect = money-moving, scope check
    R-->>M: TransferProposal - NOT executed
    M-->>PA: proposal
    PA-->>O: proposal
    O->>RA: screen proposal
    RA-->>O: risk verdict

    O->>B: execute TransferCommand, actor kind=agent,<br/>on_behalf_of=user, mandate_id
    B->>P: evaluate mandate: scope, per-tx cap,<br/>period cap, beneficiary allowlist, expiry, revocation

    alt within mandate and below confirmation threshold
        P-->>B: allow
        B->>L: post_transaction
        L-->>B: settled
    else outside mandate, above threshold, or irreversible
        P-->>B: require_approval
        B-->>U: confirmation card in the app<br/>amount, payee, agent, mandate shown
        alt user confirms
            U-->>B: approve
            B->>L: post_transaction
            L-->>B: settled
        else user declines or times out
            U-->>B: decline
            B-->>O: rejected
        end
    end

    B->>T: audit row with actor=agent, mandate_id, correlation_id
    O-->>U: result, with "talk to a person" always available
    O->>T: close agent_run, tokens, cost, outcome
